flowchart LR
    Calendar[Release calendar] --> Inventory[APIs, add-ons, nodes, webhooks, clients]
    Inventory --> Insights[Upgrade Readiness Insights]
    Insights --> Test[Test and recovery validation]
    Test --> Upgrade[Upgrade control plane]
    Upgrade --> Bake[Bake period]
    Bake --> Platform[Add-ons, clients, nodes]
    Bake --> Problem{Serious issue?}
    Problem -->|No| Validate[Complete validation]
    Problem -->|Yes, eligible window| Rollback[Rollback Readiness Insights]
    Rollback --> Revert[Node/control-plane rollback]
    Revert --> Validate
